॥ prāsādaṣaṭślokī vyākhyā ॥

(p.3b, l.1)
(side heading)(hariḥ oṃ prāsādaślokavyākhyānam) prāsādaślokavyākhyānam ।

(p.4b, l.1)
yathā mūrttigaṇādhīśa kṛpāleśānmayādhunā śrī matprāsāda ṣaṭślokyavyākhyānaṃ likhyate । (l.2)...dhakila paramaśivavācaka pañcākṣarabījabhūtasya hauṃ kārasya trikala- pañcakala-aṣṭakala-navakala
(l.3)ṣoḍaśakalabhedena śivāgameṣu bohudhā varṇitatvāt tatra dvādaśakalāprāsādā... । (l.4) mahākāraṇākhya na sthānaśūnyāṅgulādhvasu । śaktyā kṛtyoḥ kalāvyāptiṃ jñātvā ko vā... । (l.5)
iti mukhyatayā varṇitatvāt dvādaśakalāprāsādaṃ ṣaṭślokyānirūpaṃ dṛṣyan । ācārya...(l.6)(a) kārasyotpattisthāna prabhāṃ ślokārthenāha । mūlātkuṇḍalinīnivāsabhuvanā...(l.7)bhusvanohalmātrakṣaṇarociraṃ kuranibho nābhyantamāste śivaḥ ।
kuṇḍalinyāśuddhamāyāya...(l.8)...ktasagrahaṃ tasmāt mūlātpadmāt mūlādhārapadmāt utthita iti śeṣaḥ ।
marāla svana...

(p.5a, l.1)
kṣaṇarociraṃ ārambhaḥ saudāminīprarohatulyaḥ halmātraḥ svaravarjita vyañjanarūpahakāramātraśśivaḥ । śivabījaṃ na...(l.2) jñāvadhi āste varttiteyādhaḥ
kuṇḍalinī śaktiḥ māyākarmānusāriṇī nādabindvādikaṃ kāryaṃ tasyāpīti jagatsthiti...(l.3) vacanāt । śivabījasāpi kuṇḍalīnīśaktijanyatvaṃ siddhaṃ kārpāsādibhiḥ
sañcinnakarṇārandhraiḥ samāhitātmabhiḥ haṃ...(l.4) sūkṣmanādasya । śrūyamāṇatvāt antarālasvanatvaṃ siddhaṃ । uparivakṣyamāṇa medhākalāyogādvyañjanamātra... । (l.5) tvāt । harmātra iti mātra ca prayogaḥ ।
kṛtaḥ halmātraśaśiva iti pāṭhasubodhaḥ nahi śabdādṛte puṃsaḥ । pra... । (l.6)
kathanteneti vacanāt bodhakatvena prakāśarūpatvamiti vidyutkāntitvaṃ siddhaṃ nābhyantamiti sthānaniyamataḥ । (l.7)...layānasti tasya tathā sthānaniyamaḥ sahitasya tu brahmarandhra paryantamitibhāvaḥ ।
atha medhākalāyā mātrākā...śvaranā(l.8)...sthānāṅgulaṃ tatvanipādatrayeṇāhuti ūrdhvantasya vitasti laṅghini pade vedām... ।

(p.5b, l.1)
phalam । ...khāprabhātadupari vāpnoti medhāpdvatā tatvānāma...
kamalāsanasthabhagavānnātha caturvinamśateriti । atraivaṃ (l.2)padmayojyanā tasyordhvaṃ vitasti laṅghinipade hṛtkajaṃ vedāṃ śūlaṃ tadupari plutāpluta vahnīśikhāprabhāmedhā vāpnoti (l.3) tatvānāṃ caturthaṃ śateḥ kamalāsanasthabhagavānnāthaḥ
adhastutasyānābhipadmasya ūrdhvaṃ upariṣṭādvitasta laṅghini (l.4)dvidaśāṅgulādvikrānte padesthāne hṛtkandaṃ hṛdayakamalaṃ vedāṅgulañcaturaṅgulaparimitaṃ tadupari tadūrdhvabhāge (l.5)plutātrimātrāpluta vahniśikhāprabhā
dīpāgnijvālā samakrānti medhā aukārakalāvāpnoti vāpyatiṣṭhati tatvānāṃ ātmatatva(l.6)vyākhānāṃ caturvimśateḥ pṛthivyādi - prakṛtitatvāntānāṃ caturvimśati tatvānāṃ kamalāsanasthabhagavān (l.7)brahmānāthamakāraṇeśvaradhitinābhi padmādārabhya medhāsahita hakāro hṛdayakamalaparyantaṃ vāpnotīti bhāvaḥ ॥ (l.8)
atha dvitīyaśloka
dvitīyya tritīyya pādābhyāṃṃ karasakalānnirūpasthati kaṇṭheṣṭāṅgulakahimāṃśutapanajyoti dvimātrāṅkitaḥ ।

(p.6a, l.1)
śrutyuktasya tatvaṣaṭkasahitolakṣmīsahāyaḥ pumān iti
atrerthaṃpadayojanā aṣṭāṅgulakaṇṭhe (l.2)himāṃśutapanajyoti ...taḥ । śrutyaṃ iti śeṣaḥ tasya ca tatvaṣaṭkasahito lakṣmīsahāyaḥ pumānnātha iti pūrvapadādhyāhā (l.3) adhastu aṣṭāṅgulake hṛdayakamalādārabhya aṣṭāṅgulapate
kaṇṭhāvadhisthāne himāṃśutapanajyotiścandra(l.4) sūryakāntiḥ dvimātrāṅkitaḥ mātrādvayayukta ākāraḥ śrutyantasya śrutirdakṣiṇakarṇastadanto vāmakarṇātasthānīyaḥ ūkārastasya (l.5)tatvaṣaḍkasahitaḥ kalā
vidyārāgakālaniyatipuruṣākhyatatve ṣaṭkayuktaḥ lakṣamīsahāya sthitikāritvāt(l.6) rakṣāhetunnataśrī sahitaḥpumānnārādhaṇākhyaḥ karttākāraṇeśvara iti hṛdayakamalādārabhya kaṇṭhāntaṃ ūrdhvaṃ karo vāpnotītibhāvaḥ ।
atha dvitīya ślokacaturthapādena tritīyyaśloka prathamapādena ca viṣamakalāmāha । jihvāyāñcaturaṅgula viṣamakalāmātrāṅkitāsmārayet vidyudāmarūcijagatpitṛvanaṃ māyāsahāyaṃ haraṃ iti ।

(p.6b, l.1)
atraivaṃ padaye ...aṅgule jihvāmātrāṅkitāvidyuddāmaruciḥ viṣakalājagat pitṛvanaṃ māyāsahāyaṃ haraṃsmārayediti । (l.2) arthastu caturaṅgule aṅgulacatuṣṭayaparimite jihvāyāṃ kaṇṭhamūlamārabhya jihvāmūlāvaśīmātrāṅkitā ekamātrā (l.3)
parimitā vidyudanātmanastṛṭinmālāyāḥ rucirivarucimaṃ kāntiḥ yasyāssā tatho viṣakalāmakāra jagatpitṛvanaṃ (l.4)jagatibhuvanātipitṛvanaṃ śmaśānaṃ yasya taṃ rudrasya samhārakṛtya kṛtvāt
tatatho'ktaṃ jagat pitṛmayamiti pāṭhe (l.5)sakalalokapitṛsvarūpamāyā sahāyaṃ māyā mohinyāḥ sahāyaṃ sahakāritaṃ māyā sahāya ityanena viṣakalāyāmāyātatvaṃ (l.6) ekatatva tathoktaṃ iti jñeyaṃ haraṃ rudraṃ smārayet ।
dhāyayediti kaṇṭhamūlādārabhya jihvāmūlāntaṃ(l.7)makāraṃ bhāvayediti bhāvaḥ ।
atha tṛtīyaśloka dvitīyyatṛtīya pādābhyāṃ bindukalānnirūpayati tatradvyaṅgulameka(l.8) pradīpaka... madhye bhruvoḥ । mātrārthena yutaṃṃ dvitatvamilitaṃ binduñca vidyābhujā iti

(p.7a, l.1)
atrevaṃ pada yojanā iti tatra dvyaṅgulake bhruvormadhye pradīpakalikā spardhālumātrārthena yutañcivatatvaṃ militaṃ binduvidyā bhujā (l.2)adhiṣṭhitaṃ bhāvayediti viśeṣaḥ । tatra jihvā...ṅgulake
aṅguladvaya parimite bhruvormadhye (l.3)bhūmadhyaparimite yajñapradipakalikā spardhāludīpajvālā paripaṇḍimātrārdhena yutaṃ ardhamātrāparimitaṃ dvitatvamilitam । (l.4) śuddhavidyāyāṃ īśvareṇa ca yuktaṃ binduṃ bindukalāṃ
vidyābhujāmaheśvarāṇādhiṣṭhitaṃ bhāvayedityarthaḥ । (l.5) tālumūlādi bhrūmadhyāntaṃ bindukalāpabhāvayediti bhāvaḥ । atha tṛtīyaśloka caturthavādenārdhacandrakalāṃ nirūpayati (l.6) ...punarardhacandraruciraṃ mātraikapādāṅkitaṃ
ardhacandraruciraṃ mātraikapādāṅkitaṃ bindvarthaṃ bhāvayediti । (l.7)...da yojanā ardhacandraruciraṃ candrārdhakāntikaṃ ardhacandratulya prastāra idaṃ pañcakāntiprastarayoḥ sādhakamiti (l.8) jñeyaṃ mātraikapādāṅkitaṃ mātrāyā ekamātrāyāḥ
ekapāda ekāṃśaścaturbhāgaikāstenāṅkitaṃ lāñcitaṃ

(p.7b, l.1)
pādamātrāyuktamityarthaḥ । bindvardhaṃ candrakalāṃ bhāvayedityarthaḥ । ardhacandrādi nādāntaparyantasya kalā catuṣṭayasya (l.2) dānām śūlaṃtatvakāraṇeśānā... tvenātrakṛ pṛthak tayā na varṇitamiti jñeyaṃ bindukalāyāmupari ardhacandrā...vanayeti (l.3)bhāvaḥ ।
atha caturthaślokādyapadena nirodhikalāgnirūpaniyati pāṭhe rodhikalāpurodi (l.4) tarūci stṛtā pāṭhe pālasthāne puroditaruciḥ pūrvoktakāntiḥ candrārdhadīptirityarthaḥ । mātrāṣṭamāṃśā mātrāyā (l.5) ekamātrāyāḥ aṣṭamāṃśaḥ aṣāṭabhāgaikakālaḥ । etat uktaṃ bhavati makārocchāraṇe kālārdhabhāga kālaḥ (l.6) ...bhyastāraṇe bindvacchāraṇa kālaḥ ardhacandrakālaḥ ardhacandrārdhakālo nirodhikalāyāḥ kāla iti jñeyaṃ rodhikalā (l.7)nirodhikalāstrāvtyarthaḥ । asya trikoṇarūpe ... ślokadvitīya tritīyapādābhyāṃ nādanādānta kale (l.8) nirūpayati । daṇḍaṣoḍaśakāṃśako maṇinibhaḥ । paścāt bile brahmaṇaḥ daṇḍāntaḥ tṛṭi...kūra prati

(p.8a, l.1)
haṭa...stadardhaṃ śata iti ṣoḍaśāmśako maṇinibhaṃ daṇḍaḥ paścāt brahmaṇo bile taṭivaktrā pratihaṭajyoti daṇḍāntaḥ tadardhāṃ (l.2) vitasta iti śeṣaḥ । iti padayojanā ṣoḍaśāmśakaḥ mātrāyāṣoḍaśāṃśaikabhāgamātrāyuktaḥ maṇinibhaḥ māṇikya... prabhaḥ daṇḍaḥ (l.3)nādakalādaṇḍākāraprastāraityarthaḥ । paścānnādakalāyā ūrdhvaṃ brahmaṇobile brahmarandhrāvadhita dar...sya nādasya (l.4)ardhā... pātraṃśat bhāgaika bhāgamātrāyā tṛṭidūrapratibhaṭajyoti vidyutpraroha sadṛśakāntiḥ daṇḍāgni nādāntakalāvāpnoti (l.5)...dasya pārśvadvaya binduyuktahalākṛti tathā ca । prastāravadanti nādāntasya dakṣiṇapārśva binduyukta (l.6) halavat prastāraḥ ।
atha caturthaślokacaramapādena pañcamaślokaprathamapādena ca pūrvoktānāmardhacandra nirodhi (l.7)nādanādāntaṃ nāmaṅgalakāraṇeśvarānāha madhyāt bhūtale madhyāt bhūlatayoḥ bhavāṅgulamite svikṛtya tatvatrayaṃ binduvardhā (l.8)cakṛti ...bhagavānī śassadeśasvayamiti bhūlatayo rmadhyāt bhavāṅgulamite bicardhādi catuṣṭayasya tatvatrayaṃ

(p.8b, l.1)
svakṛtya bhagavān sadeśaḥ svayamīti padayojanā bhrūlataye bhūvormādhye madhyapradeśāt bindusthānāndārabhya (l.2)bhavāṃ varjite ekādaśāṅgulaparimīti sthāne a... śabdorudra vācirudrāṇāmekādaśāṃ tathā tāpyekādaśa saṅkhyāgrasyate । (l.3) ...tuṣpadasya arddhacandrādi kalā catuṣṭayasya ardhacandranirodhi nādanādāntākhya kalācatuṣṭayasya (l.4) tatvatrayaṃ sādākhyaśaktiśivābhidhaṃ tatvatrayaṃ svīkṛtyāṅgīkṛtya bhagavān sadeśasvayamīśaḥ kāraṇeśvara ityarthaḥ । (l.5) bhrūmadhyā...brahmarandhrāntaṃ pādonatrayaṅgulaṃ śruteḥ । iti vacanāt bindusthānādārabhya brahmarandhrāntaṃ ekādaśāṃ (l.6)...miti ardhacandrakalāyāḥ bhrūmadhyopari pādonatrayaṅgulapramāṇasthānaṃ tadupari nirodhikalāyāḥ (l.7) tadupari nādasyatadupari nādāntasya ca pratyekaṃ pādonatrayaṅgulatathā ekādaśāṅgulānya pakvācatuṣṭayaṃ (l.8) sthānamiti bhāvaḥ । adhāṅgulapramāṇa vivekaḥ pradṛśyate ṣaṇṇavatyaṅgulāyāṃ purūṣapramāṇe pādā

(p.9a, l.1)
mūlādhārāntaṃ aṣṭacatvārimśadaṅgulāni parityajya mūlādhārādi brahmarandhrāntaṃ aṣe्ṭacatvāriṃśadaṅguleṣu mūlādhārādi nābhyantaṃ (l.2) ...aṅgulaṃ ghoṣasthānaṃ nābhyādi hṛdayakamalāntaṃ dvādaśāṅgulaṃ ghoṣasahitamedhā kalāsthānaṃ hṛdayakamalādi (l.3)kaṇṭhamūlāntaṃ aṣṭāṅgulaghoṣamedhāsahita rasakalāsthānaṃ kaṇṭhamūlādi jihvāmūūlāntaṃ caturaṅgulaṃ vokamedhā rasakalā sahita (l.4) kalāsthānaṃ jihvāmūlādārabhya bhrūmadhyaparyantaṃ dvayaṅgulaṃ bindusthānaṃ bindusthānāt brahmarandhrāntaṃ daśāṅgulaṃ ardhacandranirodhi (l.5) nādanādāntakalāsthānamiti jñeyaṃ āhatyāṣṭacatvārimśadaṅgula parimitaṃ mūlādirandhrāntaṃ pādādi mūrdhāntaṃ ṣaṇṇavatyaṅgula (l.6) pramānamiti jñeyaṃ mūlādhārasthita kuṇḍaliniśaktijanita haṃsa ninādaśivabījabhūta hakāra suṣumnā mārgeṇa (l.7) medhādikalā...punarapibrahmarandhra samīpe nādatvena śrūyamāṇatatraiva nādāntadāmetya brahmarandhra (l.8) samīpe nādatvena śrūyamāṇa tatraiva nādāntadāmetya brahmarandhrāni līnobhavatīti vedikavyam ॥

(p.9b, l.1)
atha pañcamaślokadvitīya pādenaśaktikalāmāha tasmāt...mathaikāṅgulapade śaktiḥ kalāśāṃ śika iti atha tasmāt ūrdhvaṃ ekāṅgula (l.2) pade kalāśāṃ śīkāśaktiriti padayojanārthaṃ athe...ni nādāntanirūpaṇānantaraṃ tasmāt brahmabilādūrdhvaṃ upari ekāṅgulapade (l.3)ekāṅgula ...sthāne kalāśāṃ śikācatuṣvaṣyekabhāganātrāyutāśaktiḥ śaktikalā bhāvanīyyeti śeṣaḥ asyāḥvāmapāda (l.4)atha pārśvabinduyuktahalākṛtiḥ prastārāśatasūrya prabhāśaktyādi kalācatuṣ...nāha śivaḥ kāraṇeśvara (l.5) iti jñeyaṃ ।
atha pañcamaślokārdhena medhādi śaktyantakalānavakamadhyagata śūnyatrayañcavyāpinikalāñca nirūpayati । (l.6) śūnyānitratvakalāṃ śatastadupari vāpinyapi tryaṅgule paścāt tadviguṇāṃ śikāyugame bindūpetaśūlākṛtiḥ atroḍhapa... (l.7)yojanā tatrikalāśataṃ śūnyāni paścāt tadūpari tryaṅgule tadviguṇāṃ śikāyugalabindūpeta śūlākṛti (l.8)vipinivṛtyarthaṃ trikalāmśataḥ medhāditvāt ākhya? kalātrayavibhāgaśūnyāni śūnyatrayaṃ medhārasaviṣāvasāne prathamaśūnyaṃ

(p.10a, l.1)
bindu bhūnirodhinyuparamedvitīyya śūnyaṃ nādanādāntaśaktikalāvasāne tṛtīyya śūnyamiti jñeyaṃ medhādi kātyākhya kalāsumadhya (l.2)triṃśatrikāṇāṃ virahati śūnya ekaikahānerūpari triśūnyaṃ śūnyātparaṃ yojayayathāḥ śaivamiti vacanātpaścāt śaktikalānnirūpaṇāntaraṃ (l.3)tadupari brahmarandhrordhvagataikāṅgulāt upari tryaṅgule aṅgulatrayaṃ parimite sthāne tadviguṇāṃ śikautasāḥ । (l.4) punarvokta catuṣṣaṣṭasaṅkhyayāḥ dviguuṇāmaṣṭāvimśat adhikaśataṃ tadamśāṃ śikā aṣṭāṃ vimśatyadhikaśatāṃśaikabhāga samānamātrā (l.5) yugalabindūpetaśūlākṛtiḥ bindudvayasahitatriśūlabhāgaprastāradakṣa binduḥ śūlākṛtiriti ca ke'pi dvadanti vyāpinīṃ vāpinīṃ (l.6) kalābāvanīyyeti śeṣaḥ । asyāssahasramitya sadṛśī prabhā anāhataśevayeva karttājñātavyā ।
atha ṣaṣṭaślokapūrvārdhena (l.7)samānakalānnirūpayati ṣaṭkopetaśatārthaṃ paṅtidaśakadvandvāvaśokāṃ śikā sūkṣmāṅgī caturaṅguletha samanā (l.8)...ṣaṅgāvadhiḥ arthastu atha vyāpi tadanantaraṃ caturaṅgulabrahmarandhrordhva caturaṅgulādupari amśaṅgula

(p.10b, l.1)
catuṣ...sthāneṣaṭkopetaṃ saṅkhyāgataṃ śatārdhaṃ pañcāśat paṅtidaśaka dvandvaṃ śatadvayaṃ āhatya ṣaṭpañcāśadraktadviśata(l.2) bhāgaikabhāgamātrāyuktāśata evasūkṣmāṅgī atisūkṣmakālaparicchedyā pāśānuṣaṅgāvadhiḥ pāśapraśaktiparyantā samanāntaṃ pāśajālamunmante paraśśiva iti vacanāt samanākalā bhāvanīyyeti śeṣaḥ । yāvanmanaḥ pravṛttistāvat pāśānuṣaṅgaṃ yadā manovyāpāraśāntiḥ tadāparapadaḥ prāptiḥ
yathāṇhaśataratnasaṅgrahe -
yadā manaḥ paretatve labdhalakṣaṃnilīryayate ।
tadā viśeṣavijñānaṃ vināśa apagacchatīti ॥
sūtasamhitāyāmapi
ciktavyāpāranāśe kṛtadabhāvaṃ suraṣaṭbhāva svaprakāśena jānāti suṣupnau vedanāmīti ॥
siddhāntadīpikāyām -
abhāve bhāvamākṣityabhāvaṃ kuryāgnirāśrayam ।
amanaskemanaskṛtvā na kiñcidapi cintayediti ।
ne kriyāṇi na ca prāṇona manodhiṣaṇaiṣaṇānāhamasti na cānyosmi ciktasya
pralayena kṛcittakṣayāparāvāptiriti satyaṃ gaṇāmbike ॥ iti ca prakṛtamanusarāmaḥ manasāsahitā samanā iti śamanā śabdādhyaḥ ।

(p.11a, l.1)
asyāḥ prastāraḥ bindudvādamadhyagataṭakāravat koṭisūryatulyā atha ṣaṣṭhalokātarārdhemana unnamanākalānnirūpayet (l.2)śātivāpinī samanonmanānāṃ kāraṇeśvarānāha । sāśaktiścaturaṅgale vijayate kāpyunmanākhyā prabhoriṣṭe śakti catuṣṭaye (l.3) hataśivaṃ kalpāt koṭidyutiriti caturaṅgule brahmarandhrordhvagatāṃ aṣṭāṅgulopari gata caturaṅgula sthāne śaktyādīnāṃ (l.4) bilasordhve khatrī vedayugāṅgulamiti vacanāt । upartanayugāṅgula ityartha kalpāt koṭidyutiḥ pralayojanā (l.5) prahṛt koṭisūryaprakāśā unmanākhyā utgataṃ manoyasyāḥ sādhyate unmane ityākhāyassā (l.6)unmanākhyā mano vyāpāraśānti pradā prabho paramaśivasyakāpi anantarasādhāriṇī sāprasiddhāśaktiḥ vijayate (l.7)lokottaratvena vartate । nanamanasa ātmatatva caturvimśatyanta bhūtatvāt । vidyātatvasaptakaṃ śivatatvapañcakañca icchājñānakriyā (l.8)śaktyaścādi śaktiñcātītya varttamānāyāṃ parāśakteḥ kathaṃ unmanātvamitiścet
ucyate -

(p.11b, l.1)
icchāśaktikāryabhūtamīśvaratatvaṃ ...bhūtaṃ śuddhavidyātatvaṃ kriyāśaktikāryabhūtaṃ śaktitatvamiti ca । īśvaratatva proṇāyāṃ rāgatatvapravṛttiḥ (l.2) śuddhavidyātatvaproṇāyāṃ vidyāttavapravṛttiḥ śaktitatvaproṇāyāṃ kalātatvapravṛttiriti ca rāgatatvamanastatva pravṛttiḥ aśuddha (l.3)vidyātatvena buddhitatvapravṛttiḥ kalātatvenāhaṅkāratatva pravṛttiḥ iti ca manobudhyahaṅkāra yogādātatvavyāpāra iti (l.4) ca sarṣā...rthaḥ tasmādijñānakriyākāryabhūtāni sakalatatvānyapi tatra manasa icchāśaktisparūpatve siddhāntarahasyā (l.5) sārenoktasamamiti vacanaṃ yathā akṣāṇāṃ viṣaya pravṛttikāraṇasañcāriśīghraṃ sadāsaṅkalpaṃ kuruteva dhānajananaṃ tu icchāsvarūpaṃ mana(l.6) iticedyucyate । parāśakteḥ sahasrāmśāt kriyāśakte samudbhava iti vacanāt jñānakriyāśāntiḥ kṛta iti tasmādicchāśaktisvarūpasya manastatvasya śāntau kriyājñānaśaktyorapi śānti reva yuktā icchājñaśāgau na samudbhavet । icchāśakte sahasrāmśāt jñānaśakti sahasrāmśāt kriyāśakte samudbhava iti vacanāt jñāna

(p.12a, l.1)
kriyayonicchaiva kāraṇaṃ tasmāt kāraṇabhūtocchāśakti śāntau kāryabhūta jñānaśaktikriyāśaktyorapi śāntirityadoṣaḥ (l.2) tasmādin abhāve jñānakriyāyorabhāva eva ityuktaṃ । nanu jñānabhāve kathamicchā pravṛttiriticet satyam । jñānena icchā kriye (l.3) icchayā jñānakriye kriyayā jñānecche ityanyonyāntargatatvaṃ śaktitrayasya sakalāgamābhimathameva tathāpi satyānandajñāna(l.4) rūpiṇyā parāśaktau icchājñānakriyāśaktināmantarbhāva kathaṃ nādakhaṇḍajñānasvarūpiṇyāḥ parāśakteḥ sannidhānāt । (l.5) prathamamicchāśakteḥ eva jñānamityuktaṃ । icchāśaktirūpamanaśaśāntau sarvatatvaśāntirbhavatītyuktaṃ unmanyante paraśśivamiti (l.6) prayantumanusarāt iṣṭaityādi iṣṭapūrvapratipādite śakticatuṣṭaye śaktivyāpini samanonmanākhyaśakti catuṣke (l.7) ahataśśivaḥ anāhataśaśivaḥ śivatatvakarttā kāraṇeśvara iti śeṣaḥ । dvādaśakalānāṃ svarūpaṃ nirapyate mano vā parāśāntā(l.8) unmanā kalā śivaḥ । praśāntamanovyāpārasātmano yadāmanovyāpāra sambhavati tadā samanākalānubhavaḥ ।

(p.12b, l.1)
manaso...vāpti daśāyāṃ vāptikalānubhāvaḥ mantrotacchāraṇodyogaśaktisa... । samaye śaktikalābhavaḥ (l.2)nādaprārambhasamaye nādakalānubhāvaḥ । nivṛttikalpakarūpeṇa mantrāvasāne śrūyamānaśabdānu sandhyāne nādakalānubhāvaḥ । (l.3) binducchāraṇasya tritīyabhāgocchāreṇāvasare nirodhitī kalānubhāvaḥ । bindoruttarārdhācchāreṇa dasāyāṃ ardhacandrakalānubhavaḥ । (l.4) viṣakalāyā uparyuccāritasya bindoranu sandhānasamaya eva bindukalānubhavaḥ anantaraṃ makārocchāraṇena viṣakalānubhāvaḥ । (l.5) ūkārocchāreṇa rasakalānubhāvaḥ aukārocchāreṇa medhākalānubhava iti sṛṣṭikālaḥ kathaṃ unmanāṃ (l.6) ārabhyā ...pūrvakalāyā uttarottarakalājanyatvamiti vedyucyate medhākāraṇeśvarabhūtasya brahmaṇaḥ rukāreṇa viṣṇujanyatvaṃ (l.7) rasakāraṇa viṣakāraṇa rudrajanyatvaṃ viṣakāraṇarudrasya bindukāraṇamaheśvarasya janyatva bindukāraṇamaheśvarasya ardhacandranirodhinādāntakāraṇeśvarasadāśivasṛjyatvam । ardhacandranirodhinādāntakāraṇa

(p.13a, l.1)
sadāśivasya śaktivyāpini samanonmanākāraṇeśvara bhūtānāhataśivasṛjyatvamitya doṣaḥ । atha layaprakārolikhyate mūlādhāra(l.2) sthita kuṇḍalīni śaktijanitasya japāmantramayasya icchāsvarūpasya prāṇātmakaśivabījahakārasya nābhipadmaparyantaṃ hakārarupakena (l.3) vyāptiḥ । paścāt hakāra - aukāra - ūkāratvena kaṇṭhamūlāntaṃ vyāptiḥ । paścāt hau ū kāratvena tāliparyantaṃ vyāptiḥ । (l.4) binduyogena bhrūmadhyaparyantaṃ vyāptiḥ । bindūcchāraṇorddhasamaye ardhacandrasya vyāptiḥ । binduvasānasamaye । (l.5) nirodhini vyāptiḥ । evaṃ medhādinirodhinīparyantaṃ mūlādhārotthitasūkṣmanādahakārasya mantrajapakalpita kalāprayogaḥ । paścāt sūkṣmatathā svasaṃvedyonādaḥ । tasya nirodhinyā ūrdhvaṃ nādāntasthāna brahmarandhrapradeśe layaḥ । (l.7) nādalayānantaranādāntakalāsvakāraṇaśaktikalāyāṃ līnābhavati śaktikalāvyāpini kalāyāṃ kalāyāṃ vyāpinikalāṃ samanā

(p.13b, l.1)
malāpyunmanā kalāyāṃ nā bhavati unmanā kalāyāṃ manuṃ bhavolikhyate pṛthivyādi śivāntarṣaḍvimśatatvāni vihāya tatkāla samudbhūte (l.2) icchājñāna kriyābhiḥ parāṃ prāpya svayamapiparārūpasannibhā jñānakriyāśaaca vihāya parayāyogañca vijñāya yadātiṣṭhati tadā (l.3) unmanākalānu bhavaḥ tadānīṃ paramānandasvarūpasya paramaśivasya sākṣātkāraḥ prakṛtamanusarāmaḥ evaṃ cā daśakalānirūpaṇaṃ (l.4)dviraṣṭakalopetaṃ prāsādaṃ yonaviṣati nāsau mantrīnuvācāryo vṛthākliśyati karmaṃ sviti vacanāt ṣoḍaśakalā (l.5)prāsādopi pradṛśyate vyāpinīkalāyā ūrdhvaṃ samanākalāyāṃ adhastāt vyomarūpā anantā anāthā anāśritā iti kalācatuṣṭayasya (l.6) kalpanāt ṣoḍaśakalābhavati vyāpinī samanāntasthe vyomāṅgānantasaṃñike anāthā anāśritābhyāñca yuktodvyaṣṭakalā (l.7) śśiva iti vacanāt atha samaya sakalāḥ pañcaviśeṣasāṣṭakaṃ bhavet iti vacanāt pañcakalāṣṭakalā prāsādau nirūpyate । (l.8) tatra pañcakalā yathā siddhāntarahasye -
akāraścāpyukāraśca makārobindunādakam ।
hakārassiddhivikṛtiṃ kalāpañcakamucyate ॥

(p.14a, l.1)
aukārarvaṣṭabhāgaiśca binduvṛttārdhanādakaiḥ ।
śaktyā samanayā caiva yuktohyaṣṭakalaśśiva iti atrāpi hakārassandhivikṛtatvamanteyaṃ (l.2)
evaṃ aṣṭakalāprāsāda ...prāsāda syāvasthocchāraṇādi lakṣaṇavacanāni likhyante avasthā yathā । bījasyocchāraṇaṃ jāgrasvapno bindu ... । suṣuptijñanādasyāvasthocchāraṇādi lakṣaṇa vacanāni likhyate avasthāyathā । bījasyocchāraṇaṃ jāgratasvapno (l.3) binda... । suṣuptirnādasamyogāt turyaṃ sācchakti saṅgrahaḥ । turyāntaṃ layasthānaṃ pare mahasipaṭhyate । iti athocchāraṇaṃ । (l.4) sthūlasūkṣmaṃ paraṃ jñātvā kartṛkuryādyathephsitaṃ sthūlāṃ śabda iti proktaṃ sūkṣmaṃ cintāmayābhavet cintayārahitaṃ (l.5)yadatatparañceti kīrttitaṃ iti āṇavaśāktaśāmbhavabhedācca trayoccāraḥ dhyānasthānādhi nādocchāraṇa samucito yo bhavedāṇavo (l.6)saucintāmantrāsta śāktaśāmbhavaścit sabhesa iti ādhibhottikamādhyākṛti kamāyidaivikamiti tridhā sthūlaṃ (l.7) pūrṇākṛtiṃ varjyāt sūkṣmāntat śabda ucyate । varṇābhimānitaṃ yuktātatvarañceti kīrttayet prastāravistāratistārastaimityānu (l.8) vasānaiḥ pañcāvasthāṃ varṇāyati tatra kalānāntrikoṇa halākṛtitriśulākṛtyādi nālekhena prastāra atha vistāradhaḥ

(p.14b, l.1)
liṅgāṅgaberādi saptayoniṣu adhvasu adhibhaumepi cādhyāme vistāro darśanaṃ manoriti nistāro mantrāṇāṃ (l.2) kalapañcakalāṣṭakaladvādaśa kalatvena hrasvadīrgha plutānāntāt catvāraste krameṇa tu iti vacanāt siddhaṃ nanidrānaiva ca svapno (l.3) na ca śabdānajauttara cinmātrantatparaṃ jñeyaṃ tyāgagrahaṇavarjitamiti anusandhāna midaṃ । atha smaimityaṃ manaścakṣudvayorvṛtti prottāhi śaśi bhāskarau (l.4)candrārkanāśe yajanaṃ sarvasiddhikaraṃ paramiti uccāraṇāśapañcāvasthā yathā sthūlaśabdamitireti bindutāṃsopi nādamayameti । (l.5)sthitāṃ śaktirapyanu layena cit padantallayonabhaktaḥ prasāda iti athātmamantranāḍīśakti vyāpini samanātatvaṃ saṃñakasaptamarastho (l.6)yathā ātmanyādau samarasomamantro jñeyo dvitīyakaḥ । tṛtīyaṃ nāḍi saṃjñastu śaktau paścāt caturthakam । pañcamo vyāpini sthāne (l.7)ṣaṣṭhastu samanākriya... samaraso devī । saptamastu vidhīyyate śiṣyātmānantu saṅgṛhya pūrvoktavidhimārgataḥ । paścādātmani samyojya (l.8) lolī...vicintayet pūrakaṃ kumbhakaṃ kṛtvā samanenanirodhayet tato mantraṃ samuccārya nāde līnaṃ vicintayet mantrātmā

(p.15a, l.1)
ca tathā nāḍī evaṃ samaraso bhavet । brahmāviṣṇuśca rudraśca īśvaraśśiva eva ca tasmāt samuccaret nādoyāvacchaktau layaṃ gatam । śaktimadhyagato (l.2) nādātyātmā tu vidhīyyate sarvaśaktimayaṃ tantra sarvaṃ samarasaṃ bhavet । tadūrdhvaṃ vyāpiniṃ vyāpya sarvaṃ tāmayatāṃ vrajet । tadūrdhvaṃ samanā prāpya tanmayatvaṃ vrajet punaḥ । (l.3) adhvānaṃ prāpya brahmantu samarasyena samsthitaḥ । yatra yatra mano yāti jñeyantagraiva cintayet । evaṃ samarasaḥ prokto viṣuvaṃ kṛtibodhame । (l.4) ...tha pramāṇa mantranāḍīnāṃ praśāntaśakti kālamanassajñaka saptaviṣuvalakṣaṇa pramāṇāni yathā । pramāṇamantrasto nāḍī praśānta (l.5) śaktireva ca kālonaśca vikuṃvaṃ pravibhāgastadrucyate ātmānantu manaḥ prāṇesamyojya viṣuvaṃ bhavet mantraṃ muccārayet tāvadāvanyā (l.6)manā bhavet । sarvāsāme ca nāḍīnāṃ madhye yā savyavasthitā suṣumnā nāmasākteyā nāḍī śaktyāśivaṃ gatā tatra pravāhayannādanāḍī (l.7) viṣavamucyate । praśāntantu manojñeyaṃ praśāntendriyagocaraṃ praśāntastimitojñeyaṃ nimitto nicalastṛtaḥ tu daṣṭiṣṣoḍaśakāyāntu (l.8) prāṇasāntevyavasthitaḥ prāṇa ekatridhākālaḥ katvā caivaṃ evaṃ tyajet punaḥ । aparaśaktimūrdhvastho vyāpinyāntu

(p.15b, l.1)
dvitīyakantu tṛtīya ssamanāsthāne kālyaṃ viṣuvamucyate । unmanāparatodevī tatrātmānaṃ niyojayet tasminyuktaḥ tatahyātmānaṃ (l.2)yastu prajāyate । viṣuvaṃ vidhivat jñātvā konamucyata bandhanāt ।
iti prāsādaṣṭaślokyā vyākhyānaṃ likhite mayā samyagālocya (l.3)vibudhāmakonaucyeta bandhanāt ।
śivāya namaḥ ।
mūlāt kuṇḍalini nivāsabhavanāt padmānmarālasvanohalmātrakṣaṇarociraṅkura nibho nābhyantamāste śivaḥ (l.4)ūrdhvantasya vitastalaṅghini pade vedāṅgula hṛtkajaṃ phalladvanhi śikhāprabhātadupari vāpteti medhāplutā kāṃ tatvānāṃ (l.5)kamalāsanastha bhagavānnātha caturvimśateḥ kaṇṭheṣṭāṅgulake himāṃśuta panajyotidvimātrāṅkitaḥ । śūnyantasya ca tatvaṣaṭka sahito lakṣmīsahāyaḥ (l.6)pumān jihvāyāñcaturaṅgule viṣakalāmātrāṅkitāsmārayet । vidyuddāmaruci jagatpitṛvanaṃ māyāsahāyaṃ tatra dvyaṅgulake (l.7) pradīpakalikāsphardhālumadhyebhruvoḥ mātrārdhenayutaṃ dvitatvamilitaṃ binduñcavidyā bujā buddhiṃ punararghyacandrarucinmātra

(p.16a, l.1)
ekapādāṃ kathaṃ phālerodhikalāpurodita rucimātrāṣṭamāṃśāstratā daṇḍaṣoḍaśakāṃ śakomaṇinibhaḥ paścāt bilebrahmaṇā (l.2) daṇḍāntaṭidaṅkurapratibhaṭajyoti tadadhāṃ śato madhyāt bhūlatayobhavāṅgumite svīkṛtya tatvatrayaṃ bindūrdhvādi catuṣpadasya bhagavān (l.3) īśassadeśasvayaṃ tasmāt ūrdhvamathaikkāṅgulapade śaktikalāṃśā śikā śūnyāni trikalāṃśataḥ tadupari vyāpinya pitrayaṅgule paścāt (l.4) dviguṇāṃ śikā yugala bindupetaśūlākṛti ṣaṭkopeta śatārdhapañca tridaśaka dvandvāṃśa śeṣāṃ śikā sūkṣmāṅgī (l.5) caturaṅguletha samanāpāśānuṣaṅgāvadhiḥ sāśaktiścaturaṅgule vijayate kāpyunmanākhyā prabhoḥ iṣṭe śakti catuṣṭaye(l.6) hataśśivaḥ kalpāt koṭidyutiḥ । kāla iti ṣaṭślokī yastiścatuṣkalāpatraṃ kamalastejasānnidhiḥ nāḍīmūlāvratāṅgāhi kuṇḍalini *...nisvanā ।* (l.7)
tasmāntābhyanta māsīnoviśvarūpa taṭinibhaḥ ॥
nābherūrdhvaṃ vitastyante hṛdayañcaturaṅgulam ।
tadante saṃsthitāmethā *jaladvanhiśikhāprabhā ॥*

(p.16b, l.1)
trimātraṃ kāraṇaṃ brahmacaturvimśati tatva yuk ।
kaṇṭheṣṭaṅgulake viśodvimātrot śaśidyutiḥ ॥
tatva (l.2) ṣaṭkayuto viṣṇustālau caturaṅgule ।
amāyātatvaṃ viṣaṃ rudra ekamātraṃ staṭidyutiḥ ॥
bhrūmadhye dvyaṅgule dipanibho (l.3)vṛttardhaumātrakaḥ ।
tatvadvayayutonanto lalāṭe pādamātrakaḥ ॥
vṛttārdhe śaśijyotiḥ mātrāṣṭāśānirodhinī ।
uktaprabhāta*dordaṇḍaṣoḍaśāmśo maṇiprabhuḥ ॥* (l.4)
dvātrimśastu daṇḍānto randhresaudamini prabhaḥ ।
bhruvorūrdhvaṃ bilaṃ yāva*daṅgulaikādaśādhikaḥ ॥* (l.5)
catuśaṣaṣṭyam śikāśaktimūrdhanya ekāṅgulasthitā ।
trayaṅgule vyāpinīcāṣṭāvimśatyādhiśatāṃ śikā ॥
caturaṅgulaṣaḍyuktaṃ pañcāśadviśatāṃ śikā ।
samanordhvaṃ manomātrā caturaṅgulakonmanā ॥
tataḥ paramamātrastu tatvātītaḥ paraśśivaḥ ।
nirmalādaśanaprakhyaṃ saradvārisamaprabhaṃ
gamyānena krameṇaiva svānubhūtyāmahātmanā ॥

(p.17a, l.1)
nādaṃ kirīṭamityuktaṃ binduvaktramadāhṛtam ।
hakāraṃ hṛdayavi...kta ūkāraṃ bāhukadvayam ॥
ṣaṣṭhaṃ pādadvayaṃ vidyā mantramūrtti ssadāśivaḥ । (l.2)
ekodṛkdhṛtamaṅgalaḥ paraśśivaśāntastripañcānmakaḥ ॥
santotgrahadhātu dyagrasakalo vyaktāṇa rudrātmakaḥ ।
jambhāridvayamātrakā *padamayo vedaścaturthāparā ॥* (l.5)
antastho yokhilabīja eṣaparamo mantraśśivāyāstuva ॥
śubhamastu (l.4)
caśavdaṃ பிறந்தத்இடதிலே சகலகலை உணர்ந்தோணும் அதை உணர்த்த அறியாயோமின் சொன்ன சப்தமே சப்தம் (l.5) சஞ்சலமில்லாத (l.6)மனமே சுத்தசிவம் ... தனது ஆல்லாம உயிராகும் பேத்தரப்பை அதை விடம் பெருகும்(l.7) கனக... சயினிவே வேண்டாம். பிறவி அத்துவைதம்ஆசைஅற நினைவிடமாம்.
॥ śubham ॥



     

